# Emergency braking (docs/emergency_stop.md) on the burn-in axis (10 mm a
# revolution; 1 rad = 1.59 mm). hv0.sim_dist, zeroed at the failure, is how
# far the axis went.
# The link lost while the axis stands still: the quick stop has nothing to
# do; it ends after its 20 ms standstill check, and the axis doesn't move.
@args --drive ../hwtest/burnin/ECMA-C30604FS/stmbl.conf
@timeout 120
lcnc 0 0
run 0.5
lcnc 1 0
run 1.5
run 0.5
hv0.sim_dist = 0
lcncstop
run 0.008
fault0.stop
run 0.05
fault0.stop
fault0.en_out
hv0.sim_dist
@expect fault0.stop[1] == 1
@expect fault0.stop[2] == 0
@expect fault0.en_out == 0
@expect hv0.sim_dist ~ 0 0.01
